"When activity is completed without an associated project, this project will "
"be used to create timesheet entries. The project must have timesheets "
"enabled (validated by the timesheet bridge)."
msgstr "當待辦完成時若無關聯專案，將使用此專案建立工時表記錄。專案必須已啟用工時表。"

#. module: dobtor_mail_activity_project
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:dobtor_mail_activity_project.res_config_settings_view_form_activity_timesheet
