"project to create timesheet entries."
msgstr "當待辦完成時若未關聯專案，使用此預設專案建立工時表記錄。"

#. module: dobtor_mail_activity_project
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:dobtor_mail_activity_project.res_config_settings_view_form_activity_timesheet
msgid ""
"When enabled, completing an activity logs time into timesheet entries and "
"shows the Timesheet tab on the activity form. CRM project selection is "
"unaffected by this switch."
msgstr "啟用後，完成待辦時會將時間記錄至工時表並在待辦表單顯示工時表頁籤。此開關不影響 CRM 專案選擇。"

#. module: dobtor_mail_activity_project
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:dobtor_mail_activity_project.field_res_company__dobtor_activity_timesheet_enabled
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:dobtor_mail_activity_project.field_res_config_settings__dobtor_activity_timesheet_enabled
msgid ""
"When enabled, completing an activity logs time into timesheet entries and "
"the Timesheet tab is shown on the activity form. Disabling only hides "
"timesheet features; CRM project selection is unaffected."
msgstr "啟用後，完成待辦時會將時間記錄至工時表，並在待辦表單上顯示工時表頁籤。停用僅隱藏工時功能；不影響 CRM 專案選擇。"

